      {
        "id": "source-x",
        "source": "have fn quadratic_surface(p cart(R, R)) R = p(1)^2 + p(2)^2\nthm quadratic_surface_x_difference_quotient:\n    ? forall p cart(R, R), x R:\n        x != p(1)\n        =>:\n            (quadratic_surface((x, p(2))) - quadratic_surface(p)) / (x - p(1)) = x + p(1)\n    x - p(1) != 0\n    (x, p(2))(1) = x\n    (x, p(2))(2) = p(2)\n    quadratic_surface((x, p(2))) = x^2 + p(2)^2\n    quadratic_surface(p) = p(1)^2 + p(2)^2\n    quadratic_surface((x, p(2))) - quadratic_surface(p) = (x^2 + p(2)^2) - (p(1)^2 + p(2)^2) = x^2 - p(1)^2\n    x^2 - p(1)^2 = (x - p(1)) * (x + p(1))\n    (quadratic_surface((x, p(2))) - quadratic_surface(p)) / (x - p(1)) = (x^2 - p(1)^2) / (x - p(1)) = x + p(1)\n\n# The symmetric calculation holds x fixed and varies only y.\n",
        "path": "/Users/shenjiachen/.codex/skills/litex-equality-inequality/references/evidence/round-76-cases/source-x.lit",
